@startuml
title Invalid dietary value: set-diet diet/keto
autonumber
participant "<u>MishMash</u>" as App
participant "parser: Parser" as Parser
participant "dietParser: DietaryPreferencesParser" as DP
participant "<u>Diet</u>" as Diet
App -> Parser : parseCommand(input)
activate Parser
note over Parser : Dispatch to parseSetDiet(arguments) is condensed.
create DP
Parser -> DP : new DietaryPreferencesParser()
Parser -> DP : parse("diet/keto")
activate DP
DP -> DP : collectFields(arguments)
DP -> Diet : parse("keto")
activate Diet
Diet --> DP : throws IllegalArgumentException\nInvalid diet, valid diets, and aliases
deactivate Diet
DP --> Parser : propagates IllegalArgumentException
deactivate DP
Parser --> App : throws MishMashException\nOriginal message + usage; cause preserved
deactivate Parser
App -> App : displayError(message)
note over App : Continue the command loop and prompt again.
legend bottom
  No SetDietCommand is created and no session data changes.
  Exception construction, enum lookup, and application dispatch helpers are condensed.
  Underlined participants denote classes containing static methods.
endlegend
@enduml
